{"id": "3286900", "name": "שחזור הגרדיאנט משתי נגזרות כיווניות - גרסה מעוצבת", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">שחזור הגרדיאנט מנגזרות כיווניות</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 8px 0;\">תהי \\(f:\\mathbb{R}^2\\to\\mathbb{R}\\) פונקציה דיפרנציאבילית בנקודה \\(P={{CT:0}}\\).</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 8px 0;\">נתונים שני וקטורי היחידה</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px 12px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\\(\\displaystyle u_1=(a_1,b_1)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{{CT:1}}}}{{CT:2}}, \\qquad u_2=(a_2,b_2)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{{CT:3}}}}{{CT:4}} \\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 8px 0;\">וכן נתון כי</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px 12px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f'_{u_1}(P)={{CT:5}}, \\qquad f'_{u_2}(P)={{CT:6}} \\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: #FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">א</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">מציאת הגרדיאנט</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 12px 0;\">מצאו את \\(\\nabla f(P)\\).</p>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 9px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\nabla f(P)=\\bigl(f'_x(P),f'_y(P)\\bigr)=\\bigl(\\) [[input:ans1]] \\(\\displaystyle ,\\) [[input:ans2]] \\(\\displaystyle \\bigr)\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans1]] [[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; background: #FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">ב</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">הנגזרת הכיוונית המקסימלית</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 12px 0;\">מצאו וקטור יחידה \\(u=(a,b)\\) שבכיוונו הנגזרת הכיוונית של \\(f\\) בנקודה \\(P\\) מקבלת את ערכה המקסימלי, ומצאו את הערך המקסימלי.</p>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 9px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle u=(a,b)=\\bigl(\\) [[input:ans3]] \\(\\displaystyle ,\\) [[input:ans4]] \\(\\displaystyle \\bigr)\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans3]] [[validation:ans4]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 9px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\max_{\\lVert u\\rVert=1} f'_u(P)=\\) [[input:ans5]]</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans5]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right; line-height: 1.75; max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; color: #1f2937;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">מאחר ש־\\(f\\) דיפרנציאבילית ב־\\(P\\), לכל וקטור יחידה \\(u=(a,b)\\) מתקיים \\(f'_u(P)=a f'_x(P)+b f'_y(P)\\). לכן מן הנתונים מתקבלת המערכת</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0; line-height: 1.9;\">\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:7}}f'_x(P)+{{CT:8}}f'_y(P)={{CT:5}}\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:9}}f'_x(P)+{{CT:10}}f'_y(P)={{CT:6}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">שני וקטורי הכיוון אינם מקבילים, ולכן למערכת פתרון יחיד:</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle f'_x(P)={{CT:11}}, \\qquad f'_y(P)={{CT:12}} \\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">ולכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\nabla f(P)=({{CT:11}},{{CT:12}}) \\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">הנגזרת הכיוונית מקבלת את ערכה המקסימלי בכיוון הגרדיאנט. לכן וקטור היחידה המתאים הוא</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0; line-height: 1.9;\">\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle u=\\frac{\\nabla f(P)}{\\lVert\\nabla f(P)\\rVert}={{CT:13}}\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle \\max_{\\lVert u\\rVert=1}f'_u(P)=\\lVert\\nabla f(P)\\rVert={{CT:14}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:pgx]] [[feedback:pgy]] [[feedback:pua]] [[feedback:pub]] [[feedback:pmax]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 8, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 8, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "pgx", "value": 0.3, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tans1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pgx-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">נכון. <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f'_x(P)\\)</span> נמצא נכון.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pgx-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">השתמשו בשתי משוואות הנגזרות הכיווניות ופתרו עבור שני רכיבי הגרדיאנט.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "pgy", "value": 0.3, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "tans2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pgy-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">נכון. <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f'_y(P)\\)</span> נמצא נכון.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pgy-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">השתמשו בשתי משוואות הנגזרות הכיווניות ופתרו עבור שני רכיבי הגרדיאנט.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "pmax", "value": 0.2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans5", "tans": "tans5", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pmax-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong>נכון.</strong> הערך המקסימלי של הנגזרת הכיוונית הוא נורמת הגרדיאנט.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pmax-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lVert\\nabla f(P)\\rVert\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "pua", "value": 0.1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans"